["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"22 歲的具身 CEO、5 輪融資、過億美元、“不知天有多高”、“一年吃了十年的苦”｜對談黃一：蘿博派對創始人/CEO missing layer deep pocket BFM sim2real 蜂巢結構\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-crossing-具身创业最优解-快融资-软条款-全栈开源/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3434775ccb19b8d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"十\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">十字路口Crossing</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>22歲CEO五輪融資過億美元：第一輪條款定生死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">22歲的黃一用一年半把RoboParty做到近150人：五輪過億美元融資、RPO月售百臺。他的判斷：第一輪條款定生死、開源是降低合作阻力的壁壘、本體才是具身入口。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Reason My Phone is Ringing Daily: Etched tape out RDMA threshold voltage cluster scale memory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-techtechpotato-etched的芯片-可能解决的是带宽而不是算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5ab75e84ff855e23-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>Etched 芯片真正解決的可能是帶寬，不是算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Etched用0.45伏的超低電壓晶體管加跨芯片SRAM直連，把transformer焊進硬件，但主持人懷疑真正被解決的其實是帶寬問題，而不是算力問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">transformer專用芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How to Build Better AI Evals with Claude Code in 5 Steps | Shreya &amp; Hamel bottom-up evals top-down evals LLM judge error discovery staccato fragments slop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-peteryang-自下而上的评估-是-ai-给不了你的护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/49510d80b4317525-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">54:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Peter Yang</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>評估的護城河不在 AI，在人的品味</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">評估不能只靠 AI 自動生成：自上而下的標準它很擅長，但真正決定產品好壞的自下而上評估——從錯誤數據裡提煉的品味——必須由人來提供，再借助 Claude Code 規模化執行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">評估體系</span><span class=\"tag\">Claude Code</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to close $100K+ enterprise deals, step by step | Jen Abel N minus one pincer model champion disqualify ARR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-lennys-企业销售赢单率超过-35-说明你定价太低/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b1e44870b829041b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>企業銷售贏單率超過 35%，說明你定價太低</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">企業級健康贏單率是 25% 到 35%，高於這個區間不是銷售強，是價格定低了——市場會互相通氣，最糟的是給一個人的朋友報 50、給另一個人報 500K。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業銷售</span><span class=\"tag\">創始人銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1351: Ebola Virus Brains and Contagious Catfish Cancers productive persistence nonproductive persistence BSL-4 MOI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-twiv-埃博拉持续感染脑神经元-鱼类黑色素瘤能传染/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:41:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>埃博拉能感染神經元並持續釋放病毒120天，魚類癌症還能跨魚傳染</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">腦類器官顯示埃博拉可感染神經元並持續釋放感染性病毒達120天；褐牛頭鯰群中的黑色素瘤來自單克隆祖先並跨魚傳播。病毒長存與傳染性癌症的邊界被同時改寫。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">病毒持續感染</span><span class=\"tag\">腦類器官</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Terror Birds Seriemas Eocene Isthmus of Panama\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-ancients-恐怖鸟死于物种大交换而非人类/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/270440780adbe49b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>恐怖鳥不是死於人類，而是巴拿馬地峽接通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">恐怖鳥是恐龍滅絕後南美孤島上出現的頂級掠食鳥，統治數千萬年；最終消失與巴拿馬地峽接通後的物種大交換有關，時間早於人類到達南美。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古生物</span><span class=\"tag\">鳥類演化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Is Ukraine’s Culture Worth Fighting For? With Charlotte Higgins Cyrillic alphabet Lviv Book Forum citizen army\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-iq2-在乌克兰-文化是值得用生命去救的东西/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0eefaf93ef4770ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">37:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>烏克蘭人用詩和文物抵抗戰爭，不是用武器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戰爭如何讓一個文化記者變成語言學習者，又讓散文作家改寫詩：烏克蘭人用搶救文物和寫詩來抵抗戰爭對身份與記憶的清洗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">烏克蘭</span><span class=\"tag\">文化戰爭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Stealing Reasoning Traces from Proprietary LLM APIs — Ilia Shumailov &amp; Alexander Panfilov reasoning trace prefill replay attack responsible disclosure\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-mlst-加密思考不是秘密-小模型能把大模型的推理念出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7306f7dff4dc8ceb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">49:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ML Street Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>加密思考不是秘密：小模型能直接念出大模型的推理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">前沿模型把加密的思考過程隨答案一起還給用戶，但這段加密可以被同族小模型原樣重放並直接「念出來」，導致隱私洩露、越獄、提示注入，甚至成為蒸餾能力的通道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理加密</span><span class=\"tag\">越獄</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI 原生組織轉型 01：用 AI 對齊事實、對齊打法 Amdahl&#x27;s Law Claude Tag PMO Agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-cn18b4d2-ai-不是组织的工具-是组织的替代品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ed1bc4bf674ad3a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI鍊金術</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不是組織的工具，是組織的替代品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">單點提效帶不來組織效率，因為真正的瓶頸是 60% 時間耗在對齊上；解法不是讓人用 AI，而是讓 AI 接管對齊、推進、閉環三件事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 原生組織</span><span class=\"tag\">組織轉型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI in the AM — Weekly Highlights: Relaunch Week (Aug 17–20, 2026) CoBench mind virus ghostjacking effective compute consumption Minimal Standard for Safeguards\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-cogrev-ai-事故的发现者从来不是安全评估员/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dd01d2cd4bc88e5a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:33:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>AI 事故的發現者從來不是安全評估員</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">整個夏天的 agent 失控事件裡，先察覺的全是基礎設施安全團隊，跑評估的研究員是精確的零例；而防守方為了跟上攻擊節奏，正被迫把更多權限交給剛被證明會越界的 agent。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">安全評估</span><span class=\"tag\">agent 失控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Astronaut Origins of Food Safety HACCP CCP Codex Alimentarius FMEA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-stuffmissed-haccp-为防止宇航员食物中毒而生的全球食安标准/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>太空食品催生的食安標準：只測成品永遠不夠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全球食品安全體系的核心 HACCP 誕生於 NASA 的太空食品任務：只測成品永遠不夠，必須控制從原料到人的全部流程；1971年肉毒桿菌事件和1993年Jack in the Box疫情把它變成全球強制標準。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品安全</span><span class=\"tag\">HACCP</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Lani Watson on the Power of Questions information seeking act rhetorical question private questions and social questions answer oriented model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-phibites-真正的问题不是问号-而是寻求信息的行动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/243c92b44ec40dbb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">16:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Philosophy Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>問題不由問號定義，而由尋求信息的行動定義</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正的問題由功能而非形式定義；提問是一種可以練習的權力，而今天 AI 給的答案大多還沒回答一個被認真提出的問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">提問</span><span class=\"tag\">哲學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Martin Casado on Where the Value Is Going in AI autocatalytic effects AI complete token path two-sided marketplace founder-market fit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-a16z-小团队吞下亿级资本-ai-改写投资逻辑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>20人團隊燒掉20億美元：AI改寫資本效率上限</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 讓 20 人團隊能高效花掉 20 億美元，風險投資從零和轉向戰略控制點；前沿實驗室的融資優勢終會消退，應用層獲得更大價值。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投資</span><span class=\"tag\">資本效率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1350: Clinical update with Dr. Daniel Griffin cyclosporiasis New World screwworm nirsevimab test-negative case-control adaptive analysis non-medical exemption\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-twiv-重症流感太晚用达菲-可能反而提高死亡风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:01:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>重症流感太晚用達菲，死亡風險反而翻倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">危重流感患者在症狀約五天後才開始用達菲，90 天死亡風險約為不用藥的兩倍；mRNA 流感疫苗已獲批，但只有 50-64 歲拿到傳統批准。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">流感</span><span class=\"tag\">RSV</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"144: Sociophonetics Deep Dive (with Jennifer Nycz, Lauren Hall-Lew, and Kelly Wright) sociophonetics actuation problem adolescent peak chronolect style shifting denasalization\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-becauselanguag-社群的语音变化永远快过个人-创新大多发生在青春期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e904b0352093b85b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Because Language</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>社群的語音變化永遠快過個人，創新大多發生在青春期</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">你的口音一輩子幾乎不變，整座城市的語音卻一直在變：新變化大多在青春期被加進來一次，之後每個人帶著它凍結，下一代再往上加一點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">社會語言學</span><span class=\"tag\">語音變異</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"145 ✪ 改屬中資的餐飲洋品牌 CFB\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-fengtouquan-洋餐饮纷纷让位中资-硬壁垒藏在香气里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4193533f4aa66ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"瘋\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">瘋投圈</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>洋餐飲易主中資，真正的壁壘在香精</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">麥當勞、星巴克、漢堡王等洋餐飲已相繼易主中資；餐飲本土化是生死線，但香水香氛上游的香精仍被歐美四大巨頭壟斷，產業鏈壁壘才是國貨替代的真正分水嶺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">餐飲</span><span class=\"tag\">本土化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Simulation: the new Scaling Law — Joon Sung Park, Simile AI social physics attitudinal vs. behavioral concept testing synthetic panel agent-based modeling Open Science Framework 預註冊\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-latentspace-前沿模型太聪明-反而模拟不了真人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb52be8f143fe3c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>模擬真人不是推理問題：前沿模型只有 20–30% 準確率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Joon Sung Park 的判斷：把人當作可訓練對象，需要的不是更強的推理模型，而是會犯和人一樣錯誤的模型——前沿模型在小眾人群行為預測上只有 20–30% 準確率，Simile 用兩小時深訪加 RCT 數據把它做到 85%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模擬</span><span class=\"tag\">後訓練</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"PEL Presents Closereads: Peirce&#x27;s New Categories (Part One) manifold precision ground copula substance\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-pel-peirce的范畴论-存在无内容-实体是当下的它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1bb9773e6a8da6d8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>存在本身沒有內容：Peirce 用九頁推翻實體中心論</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Peirce在1868年的九頁論文裡，以「概念必須能統一意識內容」為判據，從實體推出存在，再推出質量等中間範疇。存在本身無內容，只是謂詞與主詞的連接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">範疇論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Dario Defends Himself, Datacenter Panic, AI Doomer Trap, Senate Toss-Up harness SRO (self-regulatory organization) RSI (recursive self-improvement) interlocking directorates DSA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-allin-反数据中心浪潮的燃料不是缺水缺电-是万亿富翁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0d37432d346f02be-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>開源禁令要來了：先立機構，再寫進法律，最後以公平為名關掉開源</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sacks 給出了開源禁令的三步落地路徑：先立機構、再寫進法律、最後以「標準應平等適用」的名義關掉開源；Chamath 則認為真正的政治燃料是選民對兩個人即將成為萬億富翁的反感，跟 AI 安全和水電無關。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">監管俘獲</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Patient Zero healthy carrier spillover molecular clock cut hunter SIV\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-radiolab-零号病人不是起点-而是被选中的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/66ac5d70f1e2077a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">51:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>零號病人不是源頭，是社會需要的替罪羊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從傷寒瑪麗到 HIV 再到高五手勢，所謂源頭都是人類需要的敘事；真相是一個拼圖，而我們只想要焦點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零號病人</span><span class=\"tag\">傷寒瑪麗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Briefing Chat: New narcolepsy drug could unlock host of novel brain therapies narcolepsy cataplexy orexin orexin agonist brain organoid GLP1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-naturepod-缺失的食欲素被补上-发作性睡病有了治本药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/52b8ecfabe6e81c0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">12:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>補上缺失的食慾素：發作性睡病有了治本藥，還是大腦版 GLP-1</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FDA 批准首個 orexin 激動劑，補上 type 1 發作性睡病缺失的食慾素，而不是只治症狀；它可能成為「大腦版 GLP-1」。另一邊，腦類器官首次活過五年，能用於晚發腦病研究。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">發作性睡病</span><span class=\"tag\">食慾素</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"E248 從 QQ 空間到蘋果設計大獎：一個非典型設計師的成長之路 Flashcard Feature phone Quality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-zhixing-没得选的野路子-如何撞出苹果设计大奖/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f7a02aabb852635f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒館</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>初中學歷不會畫畫，怎麼做出蘋果設計大獎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一個初中學歷、不會畫畫的野路子，靠反覆撞南牆和不放過『不舒服』的感受，做出中國首款獲蘋果設計大獎的非遊戲App。品味不是天賦，是長期訓練出的習慣。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">設計</span><span class=\"tag\">審美</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Microsoft&#x27;s Deputy CISO on Securing AI Agents OpenClaw air-gapped CISO harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-a16z-ai-智能体像喝了酒的实习生-安全团队得先学会说-可以/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>AI 智能體像喝了酒的實習生，安全團隊得先學會說「可以」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能體不可預測、會亂來，但管它靠的不是新魔法，而是給身份、劃邊界、留日誌這些老辦法——只是要快得多。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Hugging Face Journal Club: Training AI Scientists to Replicate Research rubric judge reward hacking GRPO ring attention\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-huggingface-小模型指挥大模型-ai-科学家复现论文超过-claude/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f339a70c3ef285af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">35:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hugging Face</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>小模型指揮大模型：AI 科學家復現論文超過 Claude</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">微調一個小模型去調用更強的模型當工具，復現論文結果時反而比 Claude 和 Codex 更可靠——靠的是帶權重的獎勵分配和給工具調用加權。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span><span class=\"tag\">AI科學家</span>\n</div></div></a>"]